{"ticker":"APO","updated":"2026-11-06T22:41:08Z","profile":{"longName":"Apollo Global Management, Inc.","shortName":"Apollo Global Management, Inc. ","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Asset Management","country":"United States","website":"https://www.apollo.com/institutional/homepage","fullTimeEmployees":6140,"marketCap":68960567296,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":10.973476,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.2614472,"pegRatio":0.44,"targetMeanPrice":148.2,"targetHighPrice":173.0,"targetLowPrice":124.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.523,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.26477,"operatingMargins":-0.45027,"profitMargins":-0.0301,"totalRevenue":30493999104,"beta":1.495,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":153.29,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":99.56,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.92},"summary":"Apollo Global Management, Inc. is a private equity firm specializing in investments in credit, private equity, infrastructure, secondaries and real estate markets. The firm prefers to invest in private and public markets. The firm's private equity investments include traditional buyouts, recapitalization, distressed buyouts and debt investments in real estate, corporate partner buyouts, distressed asset, corporate carve-outs, middle market, growth capital, venture capital, turnaround, bridge, PIPES, corporate restructuring, special situation, acquisition, and industry consolidation transactions. For credit strategies, the firm focuses on investing in multi-sector credit, semi-liquid credit, direct lending, first lien, unitranche, whole loans and private credit. The firm provides its services to endowment and sovereign wealth funds, as well as other institutional and individual investors. It manages client focused portfolios. The firm launches and manages hedge funds for its clients. It also manages real estate funds and private equity funds for its clients. The firm invests in the fixed income and alternative investment markets across the globe. Its fixed income investments include income-oriented senior loans, bonds, collateralized loan obligations, structured credit, opportunistic credit, non-performing loans, distressed debt, mezzanine debt, and value oriented fixed income s","summary_zh":"Apollo Global Management, Inc.是一家私募股權公司，專門從事信貸、私募股權、基礎設施、二級市場和房地產市場的投資。該公司更喜歡投資私人和公共市場。該公司的私募股權投資包括傳統收購、資本重組、不良收購和房地產債務投資、企業合作夥伴收購、不良資產、企業分拆、中間市場、成長資本、風險投資、週轉、橋樑、PIPES、企業重組、特殊情況、收購和產業整合交易。在信貸策略方面，該公司專注於投資多部門信貸、半流動信貸、直接貸款、第一留置權、統一貸款、整體貸款和私人信貸。該公司為捐贈基金和主權財富基金以及其他機構和個人投資者提供服務。它管理以客戶為中心的投資組合。該公司為其客戶推出和管理對沖基金。它還為客戶管理房地產基金和私募股權基金。該公司投資於全球固定收益和另類投資市場。其固定收益投資包括收入導向的優先貸款、債券、貸款抵押債券、結構性信貸、機會性信貸、不良貸款、不良債務、夾層債務和價值導向的固定收益投資","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"資產管理","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":132.6,"h":134.68,"l":131.15,"c":134.44,"v":3249900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":132.9,"h":135.37,"l":132.5,"c":134.42,"v":3932300},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":134.89,"h":137.42,"l":132.74,"c":133.64,"v":2641100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":133.88,"h":138.47,"l":133.73,"c":136.4,"v":2758300},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":136.5,"h":138.33,"l":136.28,"c":138.03,"v":2307000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":138.69,"h":139.54,"l":137.98,"c":138.48,"v":2392500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":138.76,"h":140.24,"l":138.41,"c":140.05,"v":2536300},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":140.84,"h":143.75,"l":136.37,"c":138.82,"v":5066500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":140.72,"h":144.04,"l":140.0,"c":143.49,"v":3841200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":144.87,"h":145.38,"l":143.66,"c":144.75,"v":5989900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":142.1,"h":144.07,"l":139.77,"c":143.96,"v":2806000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":143.86,"h":148.21,"l":143.37,"c":144.89,"v":3058800},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":145.5,"h":146.5,"l":137.12,"c":137.16,"v":3265100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":135.23,"h":136.95,"l":134.77,"c":136.13,"v":2721700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":136.27,"h":139.41,"l":136.2,"c":137.63,"v":2893300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":138.7,"h":139.37,"l":135.91,"c":138.44,"v":2829300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":137.7,"h":138.1,"l":130.16,"c":133.27,"v":4