{"title":"Apollo Flexes Underwriting Power With $9.6 Billion ADT Debt Deal","src":"Bloomberg.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPMTBnd25hSDlhenY4aTItWmdMYUtMN19RbTFsOU9qZEk2S1E0ZnRKbnpMcGl4dnpoc3JKTzZWRW56MTNjODNUVXpHYlh1dzk2Zjhvc3VNZGhkdXZjQ2EzelhrN0E1U05xR2tscnBjc1poeWVySnpMZXlueEdNa0kzRkM0cFRGU1BsOU02UXJ0SElaNlJNY3I0Y1Q4QWljTjRMc094Q0JtcFRjd0lsaGF6REpmRVI?oc=5","date":"2026-11-02","zh":"Apollo 透過 96 億美元的 ADT 債務交易展示承銷權"},{"title":"Kushner’s Thrive Holdings to Buy ADT for $7.6 Billion in Cash","src":"Bloomberg.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQQ084NE9HZEp0OU53QWVQN1VBX2plNGowUVdKOGNLekU0ck9nZUlPQWcxMW5najdYTURUQkp4dm4xc0NuWjRMcGxFQ1Y5YWd3UzlFQkNhSDNEb3FUNlNGc01UQ3V0bFk0ckNfa3VGb3NnODJSRTdjcmhDN0E2SUZTMV94N2JFUVNXQXVweHVaMWdyMFc0djVqTF9WS1gtN3dIMFJJbi1leVFNNnB5Y2tVOQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"庫許納旗下 Thrive Holdings 將以 76 億美元現金收購 ADT"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":6},{"name":"分析師評等","count":5},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":4},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1858681/000185868126000013/apo-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Founded in 1990, Apollo is a high-growth, global alternative asset manager and a retirement services provider. Apollo conducts its business primarily in the U.S. through the following three reportable segments: Asset Management, Retirement Services and Principal Investing. These business segments are differentiated based on the investment services they provide as well as varying investing strategies.","zh":"Apollo 成立於 1990 年，是一家高成長的全球另類資產管理公司和退休服務提供者。 Apollo 主要透過以下三個可報告部門在美國開展業務：資產管理、退休服務和本金投資。這些業務部門會根據其提供的投資服務以及不同的投資策略而有所不同。"},{"en":"Our Asset Management segment focuses on credit and equity investing strategies. These strategies reflect the range of investment capabilities across our platform based on relative risk and return. As an asset manager, we earn fees for providing investment management services and expertise to our client base. The amount of fees charged for managing these assets depends on the underlying investment strategy, liquidity profile, and, ultimately, our ability to generate returns for our clients. We also earn capital solutions fees as part of our growing capital solutions business and as part of monitoring and deployment activity alongside our sizable private equity franchise. After expenses, we call the resulting earning stream \"Fee Related Earnings\" or \"FRE\", which represents the primary performance measure for the Asset Management segment. As of December 31, 2025, we had total AUM of $938.4 ","zh":"我们的资产管理部门专注于信贷和股权投资策略。这些策略反映了我们平台上基于相对风险和回报的投资能力范围。作为资产管理公司，我们通过向客户群提供投资管理服务和专业知识来赚取费用。管理这些资产所收取的费用取决于基础投资策略、流动性状况，以及最终我们为客户创造回报的能力。我們還賺取資本解決方案費用，作為我們不斷增長的資本解決方案業務的一部分，以及作為我們規模龐大的私募股權特許經營權的監控和部署活動的一部分。扣除費用後，我們將由此產生的收入流稱為“費用相關收入”或“FRE”，它代表資產管理部門的主要績效衡量標準。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的總資產管理規模為 938.4 美元"},{"en":"Our Asset Management segment had a team of approximately 4,130 employees, including 600 employees of Bridge as of December 31, 2025, with offices throughout the world. This team possesses a broad range of transaction, financial, managerial and investment skills. We operate our asset management business in a highly integrated manner, which we believe distinguishes us from other alternative asset managers. Our investment teams frequently collaborate across disciplines and we believe that this collaboration enables our clients to more successfully invest across a company's capital structure. Our objective is to achieve superior long-term risk-adjusted returns for our clients. The majority of the investment funds we manage are designed to invest capital over a period of several years from inception, thereby allowing us to seek to generate attractive long-term returns throughout economic cycl","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的資產管理部門擁有約 4,130 名員工的團隊，其中包括 Bridge 的 600 名員工，辦公室遍布世界各地。該團隊擁有廣泛的交易、財務、管理和投資技能。我們以高度一體化的方式經營資產管理業務，我們相信這使我們有別於其他另類資產管理公司。我們的投資團隊經常進行跨學科合作，我們相信這種合作使我們的客戶能夠更成功地在公司的資本結構中進行投資。我們的目標是為客戶實現卓越的長期風險調整回報。我們管理的大多數投資基金旨在從成立之日起的幾年內進行資本投資，使我們能夠在整個經濟週期中尋求有吸引力的長期回報"}],"markets":[{"en":"Founded in 1990, Apollo is a high-growth, global alternative asset manager and a retirement services provider. Apollo conducts its business primarily in the U.S. through the following three reportable segments: Asset Management, Retirement Services and Principal Investing. These business segments are differentiated based on the investment services they provide as well as varying investing strategies.","zh":"Apollo 成立於 1990 年，是一家高成長的全球另類資產管理公司和退休服務提供者。 Apollo 主要透過以下三個可報告部門在美國開展業務：資產管理、退休服務和本金投資。這些業務部門會根據其提供的投資服務以及不同的投資策略而有所不同。"},{"en":"Our Asset Management segment focuses on credit and equity investing strategies. These strategies reflect the range of investment capabilities across our platform based on relative risk and return. As an asset manager, we earn fees for providing investment management services and expertise to our client base. The amount of fees charged for managing these assets depends on the underlying investment strategy, liquidity profile, and, ultimately, our ability to generate returns for our clients. We also earn capital solutions fees as part of our growing capital solutions business and as part of monitoring and deployment activity alongside our sizable private equity franchise. After expenses, we call the resulting earning stream \"Fee Related Earnings\" or \"FRE\", which represents the primary performance measure for the Asset Management segment. As of December 31, 2025, we had total AUM of $938.4 ","zh":"我们的资产管理部门专注于信贷和股权投资策略。这些策略反映了我们平台上基于相对风险和回报的投资能力范围。作为资产管理公司，我们通过向客户群提供投资管理服务和专业知识来赚取费用。管理这些资产所收取的费用取决于基础投资策略、流动性状况，以及最终我们为客户创造回报的能力。我們還賺取資本解決方案費用，作為我們不斷增長的資本解決方案業務的一部分，以及作為我們規模龐大的私募股權特許經營權的監控和部署活動的一部分。扣除費用後，我們將由此產生的收入流稱為“費用相關收入”或“FRE”，它代表資產管理部門的主要績效衡量標準。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我们的总资产管理规模为 938.4 美元"}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Founded in 1990, Apollo is a high-growth, global alternative asset manager and a retirement services provider. Apollo conducts its business primarily in the U.S. through the following three reportable segments: Asset Management, Retirement Services and Principal Investing. These business segments are differentiated based on the investment services they provide as well as varying investing strategies.","zh":"Apollo 成立於 1990 年，是一家高成長的全球另類資產管理公司和退休服務提供者。 Apollo 主要透過以下三個可報告部門在美國開展業務：資產管理、退休服務和本金投資。這些業務部門會根據其提供的投資服務以及不同的投資策略而有所不同。"},{"en":"Our Asset Management segment focuses on credit and equity investing strategies. These strategies reflect the range of investment capabilities across our platform based on relative risk and return. As an asset manager, we earn fees for providing investment management services and expertise to our client base. The amount of fees charged for managing these assets depends on the underlying investment strategy, liquidity profile, and, ultimately, our ability to generate returns for our clients. We also earn capital solutions fees as part of our growing capital solutions business and as part of monitoring and deployment activity alongside our sizable private equity franchise. After expenses, we call the resulting earning stream \"Fee Related Earnings\" or \"FRE\", which represents the primary performance measure for the Asset Management segment. As of December 31, 2025, we had total AUM of $938.4 ","zh":"我們的資產管理部門專注於信貸和股權投資策略。這些策略反映了我們平台上基於相對風險和回報的投資能力範圍。作為資產管理公司，我們透過向客戶群提供投資管理服務和專業知識來賺取費用。管理這些資產所收取的費用取決於基礎投資策略、流動性狀況，以及最終我們為客戶創造回報的能力。我們還賺取資本解決方案費用，作為我們不斷增長的資本解決方案業務的一部分，以及作為我們規模龐大的私募股權特許經營權的監控和部署活動的一部分。扣除費用後，我們將由此產生的收入流稱為“費用相關收入”或“FRE”，它代表資產管理部門的主要績效衡量標準。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的總資產管理規模為 938.4 美元"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Retirement Services","val":27049000000,"zh":"退休服務分部"},{"name":"Asset Management & Retirement Segments","val":20209000000,"zh":"資產管理與退休部門"},{"name":"Asset Management","val":5000000000,"zh":"資產管理部門"},{"name":"Principal Investing","val":1293000000,"zh":"主要投資部門"}],"total":32049000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Asset Management1","val":2378000000,"zh":"資產管理1"},{"name":"Investment Advice","val":1202000000,"zh":"投資建議"},{"name":"Management Service Incentive","val":245000000,"zh":"管理服務獎勵"}],"total":32049000000}},"peers":["KKR","CG","ARES","BX","OWL"]}}